---
/**
 * CallToBanner.astro — CTA Banner (msbif.org style)
 * Navy gradient box with amber accents and demo modal trigger.
 */
---

<div class="cta-outer">
  <div class="cta-inner">
    <!-- Decorative circle top-right -->
    <div class="cta-circle"></div>

    <!-- Tag pill -->
    <span class="cta-tag">
      <span>Join Us</span>
      <span style="color:#ffd166; margin: 0 4px;">•</span>
      <span class="font-['Noto_Sans_Devanagari']">आज ही प्रवेश लें</span>
    </span>

    <!-- Heading -->
    <h2 class="cta-heading font-['Poppins']">
      Start Your Journey Toward <span style="color:#ffd166;">a Better Career.</span>
      <span class="cta-heading-sub font-['Noto_Sans_Devanagari']">अपने सपनों को दें नई उड़ान — भव्य करियर इंस्टीट्यूट के साथ</span>
    </h2>

    <!-- Subtitle -->
    <p class="cta-subtitle font-['Noto_Sans_Devanagari']">
      सरकारी नौकरियों व आधुनिक उद्योग के लिए अनिवार्य कंप्यूटर कोर्सेज — अनुभवी शिक्षकों से व्यक्तिगत मार्गदर्शन व फ्री डेमो क्लास प्राप्त करें।
    </p>

    <!-- CTA Button -->
    <button type="button" data-open-demo-modal class="cta-btn">
      Book Free Demo Class &rarr;
    </button>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .cta-outer {
    background: #f5f8fc;
    padding: 22px 16px;
  }

  .cta-inner {
    max-width: 1150px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: linear-gradient(115deg, #07366C 0%, #0B4B89 72%, #1262A5 100%);
    padding: 30px 35px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .cta-circle {
    position: absolute;
    top: -62px;
    right: -42px;
    width: 180px;
    height: 180px;
    border: 24px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border-radius: 50%;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .cta-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,209,102,0.55);
    color: #ffd166;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 5px 16px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .cta-heading {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 34px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .cta-heading-sub {
    display: block;
    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.8vw, 18px);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #FFD166;
    margin-top: 8px;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .cta-subtitle {
    color: #eaf2fb;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
  }

  .cta-btn {
    background: #ffd166;
    color: #07366c;
    padding: 11px 28px;
    border-radius: 7px;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 15px;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(255,209,102,0.3);
  }

  .cta-btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(255,209,102,0.45);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .cta-inner {
      padding: 25px 17px;
    }
    .cta-heading {
      font-size: 25px;
    }
  }
</style>
